# Global DataTable Rules (ALL tables)

Apply to **every** DataTable / listing table in this project. Do **not** ship basic static HTML tables for management lists.

## Stack (mandatory)

- Use the shared factory: `resources/js/utils/datatable/` (`createApicsDataTable`).
- Library: **DataTables** (`datatables.net` + Responsive + Buttons) already in `package.json`.
- Do **not** introduce a second table library (no Grid.js / List.js for new admin lists).
- Axios SPA: no full-page reload on search/filter/sort/paginate/CRUD; toast success/error; Swal/`confirmAction` for destructive confirms only.
- Visual chrome: Velzon (`public/master`) card + Bootstrap table classes; sticky Actions column.

## Required capabilities (every applicable table)

1. **Core:** global search, sort, multi-sort where supported, pagination, page-size, first/prev/next/last, record counts, clear/reset, loading / empty / no-results / error states.
2. **Filters:** relevant dropdowns only (status/type/etc.); compose with search; provide **Clear filters**.
3. **Export:** Copy / CSV / Excel / PDF / Print when appropriate; export **current filtered** rows; exclude Actions column. **Export → Print** must use the government letterhead via `printDataTableGovernment` (never stock DataTables print).
4. **Column visibility:** Columns menu; **Actions column must stay visible** (never hideable).
5. **Row actions (icon-only):** Action column uses a compact icon-only `[⋮]` (kebab) button — **no visible text labels on the trigger button** (never “Edit”, “Delete”, “Approve”, etc. as cell buttons). Labels belong **only** inside the dropdown / right-click menu. Only **real** API-backed actions.
6. **Right-click context menu:** same core actions as the Actions menu; no fake items; dismissible; disable browser menu on rows.
7. **Delete:** never immediate — confirm → loading → toast → refresh table **preserving** page/search/filters/sort.
8. **Responsive:** progressive column hide by priority; expandable child row (label/value); **Actions fixed on the right** (not shoved into child details); no “scroll forever to find Edit”.
9. **Mobile:** same icon-only `[⋮]` — never a row of labeled buttons in the Actions cell.
10. **Performance:** server-side search/paginate when datasets grow; debounce search; avoid loading thousands of rows client-side.
11. **One standard UX:** pages differ only by columns, filters, and actions — not by reinventing table behavior.

### Actions column — icon-only (mandatory)

```text
✅ Cell trigger: icon only (⋮ / ri-more-2-fill), with aria-label="Row actions"
✅ Menu items: full text labels (View, Edit, Delete, …)
❌ Never: [Edit] [Delete] [Approve] text buttons in the Actions cell
❌ Never: icon + text on the Actions trigger button
```

Keep dropdown / context menus wide enough that labels are **not truncated**.

## Implementation checklist (before saying done)

- [ ] Built via `createApicsDataTable` (or extended it — not a one-off fork)
- [ ] Search, sort, pagination, page-size work
- [ ] Filters compose + Clear filters
- [ ] Export respects filter/search state
- [ ] Colvis keeps Actions visible
- [ ] Right-click ≡ Actions menu (same real handlers)
- [ ] Delete confirms; table refreshes without full reload; state preserved
- [ ] Actions cell is **icon-only** `[⋮]` (no text on the trigger button); menu labels are full and untruncated
- [ ] Responsive child rows; Actions sticky/visible; tested ~375–1920px
- [ ] No console errors; no duplicate table libraries

## Anti-patterns

```text
❌ Manual <tbody> string HTML as the only “table”
❌ Horizontal scroll as the only mobile strategy
❌ Hiding Actions inside responsive child details
❌ Text buttons / labeled CTAs in the Actions column (must be icon-only ⋮)
❌ Truncated action menu labels
❌ Fake context-menu items
❌ alert()/confirm() instead of toast + confirmAction
❌ Page reload after CRUD
```
